{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh",{"Oh! You scared me half to death, I thought you were one of them - sorry, I'm jumpy","You're not bit, are you? No? Okay, good - stay away from the church, there's a bunch of them inside","I can't stop long. Don't let one of those things get close, okay?","Is it true they're shooting people at the roadblock? No, don't tell me - I don't want to know","Oh thank God, you talk, the last three people I saw didn't - please be careful","You're real, right? Say something else - okay - okay, good","I had a whole speech ready for the first person I met - can't remember a word of it"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=1,12",{"Sorry for staring, I haven't seen a living face since Tuesday"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=0,14",{"Please tell me the Army's finally coming - no? Alright - stay safe, I've got to get home"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good Lord, a real person. Take care out there"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|sex=f",{"I'm looking for someone. You probably haven't seen them. Never mind","I'm Glenda - that's it, that's all I wanted, somebody else to hear it"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|world=door",{"It's so awful out here... Keep a door between you and them, okay? I really have to go"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|sex=f|day=0,10|world=road",{"I lost my husband Friday, sorry, I don't know why I told you that - mind the dogs up the road, okay?"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"Hi there - just you? Me too, I keep talking to myself, so it's nice to have somebody answer"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=family|tmp=fresh|hour=16,5",{"We're holed up with my in-laws, God help me - don't knock after dark, my father-in-law shoots first"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=family|tmp=fresh",{"Mamaw keeps asking when her programs come back on, I tell her soon, you take care of yourself","My boy asked if you were sick like chicken pox - I said no - wave at him, would you?"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=family_elder|hour=17,22",{"Evening, hon - you eaten anything today? You're thin as a rail"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=family_elder|sex=f",{"I buried my husband in '79 and I've managed alone since - this won't be what gets me - mind the ditch, it's slick"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=family_youth",{"Are you from around here? I go to school in Rosewood - went, I guess I went","Dad says don't talk to strangers anymore, you seem okay, though - don't tell him I said hi"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|hour=12,18",{"Afternoon, I was on second shift at the plant when it started - never did clock out"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly|world=vehicle",{"You need a lug wrench or a jack, I've got a truck bed full - just ask before you take"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker,civilian|tmp=seasoned|world=door",{"Lot of traffic on the Dixie Highway before the Army blocked it - now it's just cars with the doors hanging open","Afternoon, if you're gonna stand there, stand out of the doorway"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_medical",{"Anybody hurt with you? Show me cuts, not bites, bites I can't do a thing about","Show me cuts, cuts I can work with - keep the rest to yourself"}},
