{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_clergy|hour=16,5",{"I won't preach at you, just tell me your first name, so somebody's praying for it tonight"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_firefighter,worker",{"Water was still running at the Muldraugh firehouse yesterday, thought you ought to know"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|role=law_deputy,law_sheriff|st=neutral",{"Sheriff's office, you're fine, just keep your hands where I can see them while we talk"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|tmp=seasoned|hour=12,19",{"Afternoon, we're asking folks to stay inside after dark - I know - I know - still asking"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=law_deputy|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Deputy Harlan, county, anybody been giving you trouble on this road, I want to hear about it"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=law_trooper",{"State Police, you're a long way from anywhere - don't try the bridge, they've got it shut hard","State Police, if you're aiming for the Carver bridge, it's held - held hard"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=law_sheriff",{"Easy now, I'm the sheriff, what's left of the office anyway - move along, and quiet about it"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=law_corrections",{"Twenty years I worked the county jail, never thought I'd miss count time"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=swat",{"Police. Keep it calm and we won't have a problem","Hold up - police - you okay?","Easy, we're the good guys - keep your hands out"}},
