{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military|tmp=veteran,seasoned|st=neutral",{"Civilian, that's close enough, you're not on my list of problems, let's keep it that way"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military|tmp=seasoned",{"If you're headed for the checkpoint, don't bother, they're not processing anybody"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military|tmp=seasoned,veteran|world=road",{"Any bites, scratches, fever? No? Then move along, and stay off the base road"}},
