{"GREET_PLAYER","role=soldier_nco|world=road",{"Relax, if I wanted you on the ground you'd be there - what's the road like behind you?"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=elite",{"Stop, show hands - good - move on","Don't stop where the water tower can see you, that's free advice"}},
