{"GREET_PLAYER","role=militia",{"We watch this stretch, folks passing through, fine - folks stopping, we have a talk"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=civilian_loner|world=road",{"Didn't expect company, I'll keep to my side of the street, you keep to yours"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=civilian_loner",{"Last fella I talked to was real nice, four days ago, I'd have liked him to stay that way"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned",{"You look about as wore out as I feel, {town} chews everybody up lately","Don't go past the second cattle gate out Echo Creek Road - that's all I'll say"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"If you're going through {town}, stay off the main drag - we lost two there Sunday"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,law|tmp=seasoned,veteran|hour=5,11",{"Morning, coffee's gone, so don't ask me how I am"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Howdy, you're the first person all week who didn't try to bite me or rob me - keep it up"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker|world=water",{"Don't drink out of the creek past Tanner Road, something's in it upstream"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,rescue|world=door",{"You headed for Cedar Grove? Don't, them doors are chained from the inside"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh,seasoned",{"I've been talking to a dog for nine days, you'll have to be patient with me"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker",{"There's a warm coke in my bag - you want it? I can't drink 'em warm"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,worker,outlaw|world=door",{"Careful on Halbert Street, somebody chalked numbers on every door up there"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker,civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|world=vehicle",{"You look walked out - sit on the tailgate a minute, I don't care"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker,civilian|tmp=seasoned|sex=m",{"Name's Delbert, I ain't shaking hands - nobody does anymore, no offense"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,worker,outlaw|tmp=seasoned|world=door",{"Sav Rite's stripped, but that stockroom door's still shut, somebody ought to try it"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned",{"Water's still good at the Kelso place, hand pump out back - don't tell the county"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=family_elder",{"Y'all eaten? Don't lie to me, I can see your belt"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=rescue_clergy",{"I got cots in the fellowship hall and no coffee for 'em - sit anyway"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|tmp=seasoned|world=vehicle",{"Deputy Kemble - you seen a blue van with a busted taillight? No? Alright"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|role=law_deputy,law_sheriff|tmp=veteran",{"Sheriff's office, I'm not stopping you - I'm just tired of talking to myself"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military|tmp=seasoned|world=road",{"Don't cut the base road, there's a kid on that gate more scared than you are"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","role=elite_delta,elite_operator",{"You're in our lane, twenty yards left and we never met"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,crime|st=neutral,friendly",{"You didn't come out of {town}, did you? Good, nobody comes out of there"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,friendly",{"Evening, I ain't robbing anybody today - enjoy that while it lasts"}},
