{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military,elite",{"Halt, okay, you're fine - keep moving","Morning - got any papers on you? No? Didn't figure","Afternoon, if you're looking for the evac point, there isn't one","Hey, you look like you've been walking a while"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=rescue",{"You hurt anywhere? Let me look at you","Hi, I'm a nurse - or I was - you need anything?","Hey, sit down a second, you look pale"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=raider,gang,club,prison",{"Well, hello there - Whatcha carrying?","Look at this - a tourist","Hey {g:buddy|lady}, nice boots - what size?","Evening, friend, pay the toll and we're buddies"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"Folks, aim for the head, body shots don't do squat","Hey, you! Don't get bitten - not once - understand me?","{sir}, they aren't people anymore - don't hesitate","You armed? Good, fight for your life - don't wait for us","Keep your distance from the infected, one bite is all it takes","Don't count on talking them out of it. Keep your distance","Everything you've heard is true - go for the head and keep moving","Sheriff's office, we can't protect everybody - protect yourself","Citizen, they're not sick, they're gone - don't let them touch you","If someone you love is one of them, you can't help them - I'm sorry","If they get hold of you, they won't let go - strike first and strike high","They come in from the sides, head shots only, that's all that works","Get indoors, board up, stay quiet, that's the best advice I've got","We're doing what we can, if one gets close, destroy the brain","Don't go back for anyone who's been bitten, you'll lose them both","No, I don't know what it is, just don't let one bite you","Do not approach anyone who's acting strange, do not turn your back on them","Whatever's going around, it sure as hell isn't the flu","I've shot three of them, you have to hit the head or they keep coming"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3|world=road",{"Stay off the street, if you see one, hit it in the head, that's all that works"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3|world=trees,road",{"Evening- county roads are shut, and I'd stay out of the woods tonight"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"Folks are saying it's contained - it isn't - be careful out there","Anyone bitten needs to be reported immediately, do not hide it from us","We're short on units, if you can defend yourself, do it","The infected don't feel pain, you can't scare them or shoot them in the chest - head only","Stick together and don't split up, those who go off alone don't come back","You look like you can handle yourself - good, you'll need to"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3|world=door",{"Go home, lock up, and nobody opens that door for a stranger, you hear?"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5",{"Fight for your life, nobody's coming to hold your hand","They're not human anymore - remember that when you hesitate"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, hi, I wasn't expecting anybody - are you... okay?","Hello? You're real, aren't you? Sorry, it's been a long few days","Hi. You can stop a minute if you need to","Hey, morning - well, whatever time it is","Name's Wade, I don't shake hands anymore, but, hello","Where you coming from? Did you pass the high school?","How long have you been on your own? I'm at nine days","You don't happen to be a plumber, do you? Don't laugh, I'm serious","If you see a clean bathroom, mark it for me","I'd be careful drinking water if you don't know where it came from","Church on the hill still has cots, if you're stuck","Can you spare a bandage? I'm not asking for charity, just a bandage","Twenty years at the Ford plant in Louisville and never missed a day, look at me now","I've got a cat in my coat, don't tell anyone, he's all I've got","I'd give a lot for ten minutes of the Weather Channel, even bad news","You hear that? No? Me neither, I keep checking","It's strange to have somebody just stand there and talk","I used to mind the dark. Now I don't like being where I can be seen","You don't look sick, but they say you can't tell, so, forgive me","Stay a minute if you want, I'll try not to cry","I don't know the date, the time, or my own phone number, but hello","Excuse my staring, I'm memorizing your face in case I need to describe it","I've been collecting names, in a notebook, you want to be in it?","I wouldn't go toward anybody making a racket","I found a harmonica yesterday, so I'm doing fine","Would you believe I used to complain about traffic?","Would you mind if I just stood next to you for a second? I'll go in a second","You have any idea what's wrong with them? Don't say it's a virus, I can't","I keep a list of rules, number one is don't whistle, you can have the rest"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hi- shh, quiet please, the baby finally went down","Hello, we're just trying to keep the kids calm - are you alone?","Oh, thank goodness, a real person - my boys were scared","Good to see a friendly face, we haven't seen one in days","We've got a spare cot, if you need it, it's only for a night","Do you want to say a prayer with us? Only if you want","We've been eating the same soup since Sunday, do you want some? It's mostly water","Our oldest keeps asking about school, and I don't have an answer","My mother's in the next room, she doesn't know, I'd like it that way","It's hard to hide anything from kids, they know everything","The baby's colicky, so, sorry for the noise","My grandmother's asleep, so keep your voice down, she hasn't slept in days","We came from Valley Station, it's worse there, I'd stay away"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Afternoon - don't mind the mess, still sorting out what's salvageable","You need something? I'm about worn out","Mornin' - got a minute? We could use another hand","Hi, if you're looking for tools, I might have something","If you see a goose with a hard hat, he works here - don't argue with him","Hey, you got a light? Never mind, I don't smoke, I just like asking","Don't shake my hand, it's all grease, been under my truck all week","You in the union? No? Whatever, I'll talk to you anyway","Heard they're giving out gas at the fire hall, that true? Probably not","I'm the one who fixes things, if there's anything left to fix","My shift's over, but nobody told the dead","Hell of a time for a layoff, ha, hell of a time","I've got a socket set and a cold sandwich, I'm rich","Whole crew ran off except me. Don't know why I stayed","You got a pack of gum? Anything? My mouth tastes like a battery","Don't suppose you're looking for work? The pay's lousy, the boss is dead","Any minute now the foreman's gonna show up and ask where my timesheet is","Ten years at the distillery, and I never once got drunk on the job, almost","Boots, jacket, hard hat, still dressed for work, funny how that goes","If you see a guy with a green toolbox, he owes me forty bucks","Somebody smashed the vending machine at the plant, can't blame 'em","I just spent an hour on a jammed padlock, I think it won","You look like you know how to use a wrench, don't deny it","I'm worn out. You got enough left in you to lend a hand?","My hands are cut to ribbons, but at least I can still hold a hammer","Name's Dale, mechanic, don't ask me to fix anything that runs on hope","I've had enough of ladders, enough of stairs, enough of everything","I fixed a pump yesterday, and it felt like a miracle","Anybody tell you the cannery's wide open? It's full of cans, just cans","We're rebuilding a fence at the Ridge, always room for another pair of hands","I used to carry boxes for a living, so, I know a little about heavy","I just fixed a well, so, if you need clean water, I know where","Union card's in my wallet, in case anyone asks, nobody asks","Shit, I'm tired, and I'm hungry, and I'm talking to a stranger, what a day","Fuck it, I'm going home, wherever that is","I can listen. Doesn't mean I'm not scared shitless","Hell, I'd trade my truck for a cold beer. I love that truck"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hello - do you need medical attention? We're set up just inside","Peace be with you, friend, you're welcome to rest","Welcome, we've got water, if you need some","Easy, I'm only checking that you're alright","Anybody hurt? Burned? Bitten? I have to ask","You look dehydrated, there's water at the station if you want it","We've got a cot or two, if you need to lie down for a bit","I'm sorry I keep asking questions, it's what I do...","Nobody's forced to come, but there's food at the church hall","We lost most of the crew yesterday, so you'll forgive my face","Have you seen any kids on their own? We're looking for some","You're not sick, are you? Say it plain, I won't judge","I've been awake since Friday, if I talk too fast, that's why","We could use more hands, if you ever want to stop by","Please tell somebody if you find someone injured, we'll come","Are you hungry? The church kitchen's got a pot","There are wounded at the school gym, if you've got the stomach for it","Don't worry, I won't ask if you're bit, you'd say, right?","I'm sorry for the smell, it's the hospital, it's in my clothes","We've set up a clinic at the school gym, if anyone needs","Let me look at your eyes, quickly, for fever, thank you","It's good to see a face that isn't scared out of its mind","Are you carrying any antibiotics? I'll swap you for a first aid manual"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Evening, fire company's holding the street - you hurt?"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Evening - Knox County Sheriff's, you're clear to pass - stay on the road"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"Afternoon, {sir} - keep your hands visible and we won't have a problem","This is a patrol - do you need assistance?","Morning- keep it moving, nothing to look at here","If anyone asks, I was never here, and neither was the donut","{Sir}, got a minute? Just a couple of questions","Where are you headed?","Anyone with you? Anyone behind you?","You hurt? Need medical? I'm not a medic but I can call one","I'm not asking for ID, nobody's got ID anymore","County's got a place at the courthouse if you need a cot","We're keeping a list of names, in case somebody comes looking for somebody","Lost kid, about nine, red backpack, have you seen him?","You seen any of the sick ones close to town? Be honest, I won't panic","What's the news from where you came? We haven't had radio in two days","You wouldn't be a nurse, would you? Or a mechanic? We're short on everything","Is that your first time through here? You look a little lost","You don't have to answer, but where'd you sleep? Sorry, just asking everybody","Sorry to stop you, but we're counting people, it helps to know who's still around","Don't mind the gun, it's habit, I'm not going to point it at you","I'm a cop, if that's who you're looking for","Stay out of the east end if you can, it's bad, that's all I can say","Do me a favor and don't stare at the holding cell, folks keep doing that","No ID check today, just a favor, keep an eye out for me","You're not under arrest, so relax, I just want to talk","We're a small department, but we try to keep a lid on it","Keep an eye out for a man in a gray hoodie, he's trouble","We had a break-in at the grocery, which is funny, because, you know","You'd tell me if you saw something odd, wouldn't you? I'd tell you","Anybody bothering you? I've got time, believe it or not","Sorry to stop you, I just haven't seen a stranger in a week","County... I mean, deputy, hi","Quick question, you got a minute?","Seen a man with a limp? Gray jacket?","Just checking in on folks, you alright?","You live around here?","Do you have somewhere to stay?","I keep reaching for my coffee. Haven't had any in days","Shit, you scared me, I thought you were another looter"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Friendly - move along, citizen","Stay clear of the building, we're working it","You're clear - keep your hands where I can see them","Police, stay put, we're passing through","Clear? Good, we'll stay out of your way if you stay out of ours","We've got a task, not your business, move on","Are you hurt? We've got a medic, just say the word","Keep it moving, civilian, we don't have time to talk","Everything okay? We'll stop if you need us","Don't follow us, it's not safe where we're going","You didn't see us, we didn't see you, understood?"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Halt, state your business - keep your hands where I can see them","Civilians, move along, this area's not for you","Move along, {sir}, this is a restricted area","Civilian, state your business, then keep walking","Any fever? Any bites? Be honest, it's for your own good","Where have you come from? How many with you?","Is there anyone behind you? Anyone following?","Orders are no one passes without screening, so, answer a few questions","Do you have any weapons? You can keep them, but I need to know","We've been told to hold this position, so that's what we're doing","The evacuation's not here, I know what you were hoping","Keep moving, we're stretched thin, I'm sorry","Is there a doctor with you? We don't have one, I'm sorry...","I can't say more, but I'd head home if I were you","If you see any of ours who've deserted, don't help them","Take whatever you've got and go, nobody's chasing you","You're not a threat, so I'll let you pass, but quickly","Any idea where I can get a hot meal? Don't answer, I'm kidding","Do you have a radio? We lost ours, so we're trading information","I'd salute, but you're not in uniform, so, hello","Civilian, a question","Any sickness where you've been?","We're asking everyone, any bites?","Where's your group?","Damn rations taste like dirt, and I've tasted dirt","Hell, I'm nobody special, just a guy in a uniform"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5|world=road",{"You're clear to pass - stay off the road after dark"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"You're alone - good","Pass - quietly","Walk on by, eyes forward","Civilian, you're not supposed to see us, continue on","Your business?","Any trouble behind you?","Stay clear of this sector","We're not here, you understand?","Quiet, civilian, we're working","Avoid the hospital, that's all I can say","You can pass, but don't linger"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sit a spell, if you're tired. I don't mind the company","Evening, traveler - got anything worth trading?","Hey now, don't be shy - I don't bite","You thirsty? I've got a jar and no questions","What's your story? Make it short","You look like trouble, and I like trouble, so stay a minute","I've got a crooked past and a straight back, don't mind me","I've been robbed twice this week, and I robbed once, so, we're even","Who sent you? Nobody? Even better","I know every trail between here and the river, if you ever need one","You've got an honest face, that's probably why you're alone","You need something? We're not handing it out for free","Funny how nobody asks questions anymore, I miss being asked","Cops are gone, so I'm just a guy with a hobby","I make a good moonshine, you know, if you ever need to forget","You've got an honest walk, I'll give you that","I don't go looking for a fight. I'd like to keep it that way","Shit, I could use a drink, and so could you, by the look of it","Damn world's gone to hell, and I'm the only one enjoying it","Fuck it, I'll talk to you, why not"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Eyes down - pass - don't stop"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"You stopping, or just going to stand there?","Well, well, what've we got here?","Alone? Aw, that's cute","You've got a lot of nerve, walking up on us like that","Easy, I'm in a good mood, don't ruin it","All brave, all by yourself, aren't you","You lost? Go on, wander off, I'm not in the mood to teach you","Hah, you look scared, good","What's the matter, never seen a person before?","You want something, say it, I've got all day","You got a name? Doesn't matter, I'll forget it","You're not scared enough, which makes me curious","Don't stare, it makes me think I've got something you want","Everybody runs or freezes, you just stand there, weird","Hell, I like the quiet, you're ruining it","Who the fuck wanders around alone in this? You crazy?","Shit, you're brave, stupid, but brave"}},
